{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-About_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly\u2019s Meadow is a relaxing idle game that sits on your desktop. You can resize it and place it anywhere to create the perfect peaceful backdrop for your day. Milly moves through the meadow on her own. Interaction is minimal, with no tasks and no pressure. Just watch, listen, and enjoy the soothing sounds of nature, gentle activities, and original lo-fi tunes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Millys_Meadow_Raking.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Customise_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock optional outfits to customise Milly and match your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/new-hat.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/customise-apparel.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Decorate_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock optional decorations to design the meadow the way you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/customise-meadow.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Activities.png?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add optional activities to your meadow for Milly to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/fish.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/farming.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/Title-Work_Millys_Meadow.png?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Milly's Meadow sits on top (or behind) your applications while you work or unwind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063730/extras/while-working-or-playing.gif?t=1752747944\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Meadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3063730/6097a7b94bbbca4cf6100714a51e170bfabadf22.jpg"},{"name":"Dressed for the Breeze","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3063730/82fd5392904b6b60af4ffc14dc82d094cbae0321.jpg"},{"name":"Pebble Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3063730/1be67a8eaa82db4de33